OL,3,GNEWSARAF pilots who ejected moments
OL,4,Abefore crash expected to make full
OL,5,Arecovery
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo pilots who ejected and parachuted
OL,8,Fout of from their plane moments before
OL,9,Fit crashed are expected to make a full
OL,10,Frecovery, the RAF has said.
OL,12,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,13,Fout of the RAF Valley station on
OL,14,FAnglesey on Wednesday when it plummeted
OL,15,Fto the ground in the nearby
OL,16,FPencarnisiog area.
OL,18,FHawk operations have been paused by the
OL,19,FRAF as a "precautionary measure" while
OL,20,Finvestigations into the crash are
OL,21,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
