OL,3,GNEWSARAF pilots who ejected moments
OL,4,Abefore crash expected to make full
OL,5,Arecovery
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, the RAF said the two
OL,8,Fpilots, who were treated for minor
OL,9,Finjuries, are "doing well" and are
OL,10,F"expected to make a full recovery".
